OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's next after Donald Trump's
OL,4,Aunited Ireland comments?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNothing is out of bounds in the
OL,7,Funpredictable world of Donald Trump.
OL,9,FEven the most sensitive of political
OL,10,Fissues is considered fair game by the
OL,11,FUS president.
OL,13,FSo should we be surprised when he
OL,14,Fstrays on to the political minefield of
OL,15,FIrish unity and declares his
OL,16,Ffull-throated support for
OL,17,Freunification?
OL,19,FWell yes, because prior to his
OL,20,Fdeclaration on Saturday, President
OL,21,FTrump avoided any tricky questions
OL,22,Faround Irish unity.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
